# Keep the build context small + safe for the HF Space.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Runtime data + raw sources are downloaded at startup from the HF dataset repo,
# never baked into the image (huge + license-restricted).
data/
storage/

# Secrets / local env — never ship these into the image.
.env
backend/.env
frontend/.env
**/google_credentials.json
*.key
*.pem
.hf_token
**/*secret*
**/deploy_secrets*

# Docs, tests, scratch — not needed at runtime.
docs/
**/tests/
*.md
!README.md
